Z||000000||Cliff Pennock||09-12-2000||03:21 PM||||Remember I told you I was working on that Fiero Forum CD? Well, it's not going as fast as I hoped it would go. Why? Because I'm having a ball reading the messages! I'm constantly doing tests on the search engine and the display part of the program. I always end up reading messages for hours at end instead of programming. And I've gotta say that the folks here are the funniest bunch of people I've met online! Even the few flamewars are hilarious (I just laughed my a$$ off reading the "Spark Plugs" thread)!<P>Just needed to get that off of my chest!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">||||reg||10
